        <mxCell id="MVATHw5-VSXownZHb5dM-44" parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;gradientColor=#7ea6e0;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="Decision: Approach B. &#xa;I would rather address the point where the mistake starts instead of adding more manual checks to the same spreadsheet. The tradeoff is that the interface takes more effort to build, potentially initial cost, and training for staff. Until approved, the paper process must remain available so the archive can continue operating.&#xa;" vertex="1">
